33
00:02:03,640 --> 00:02:08,770
Episode 28:
Time to Say Goodbye to Everyone

34
00:02:03,640 --> 00:02:08,770
Translation: ARE-YOU-SURE
AreyousureSubs Presents

35
00:02:04,240 --> 00:02:09,640
Right now, Captain Ozora Tsubasa-kun is raising the championship pennant to the sky!

36
00:02:09,640 --> 00:02:12,770
We congratulate the champion Nankatsu SC!

37
00:02:12,770 --> 00:02:14,900
We did it!

38
00:02:14,900 --> 00:02:17,030
Hooray! Hooray!

39
00:02:17,030 --> 00:02:18,940
You're so cool, Tsubasa!

40
00:02:18,940 --> 00:02:19,990
You're amazing!

41
00:02:19,990 --> 00:02:22,950
Congratulations, Tsubasa-kun...

42
00:02:22,950 --> 00:02:27,430
Additionally, Tsubasa-kun was selected as the tournament's most valuable player and...

43
00:02:27,430 --> 00:02:31,330
...became the tournament's goal king with 31 goals.

44
00:02:31,330 --> 00:02:34,620
His father, Tsubasa won.

45
00:02:34,620 --> 00:02:36,250
He did it, Roberto.

46
00:02:36,950 --> 00:02:38,650
What?

47
00:02:38,650 --> 00:02:39,760
Roberto?

48
00:02:39,760 --> 00:02:45,810
And Tsubasa-kun's partner Misaki-kun is in first place with a total of 15 assists.

49
00:02:45,810 --> 00:02:49,930
Here are the tournament's top 20 players.

50
00:02:49,930 --> 00:02:55,400
There's no doubt that these youngsters will determine the future of Japanese football!

51
00:02:56,770 --> 00:02:59,690
Tsubasa-kun, can we hear how it feels to be champion?

52
00:02:59,690 --> 00:03:01,560
Of course! I'm very happy!

53
00:03:01,560 --> 00:03:03,780
Now that you're champion, what's your next dream?

54
00:03:03,780 --> 00:03:07,290
I will go to Brazil with Roberto!

55
00:03:10,340 --> 00:03:12,720
We came second!

56
00:03:12,720 --> 00:03:14,360
Hold your heads high!

57
00:03:14,360 --> 00:03:15,280
Yes.

58
00:03:15,280 --> 00:03:17,500
You played amazingly.

59
00:03:18,780 --> 00:03:19,670
You...

60
00:03:19,670 --> 00:03:26,180
Hyuga Kojiro-kun, we want you at Toho Academy, provided the conditions we discussed remain the same.

61
00:03:27,380 --> 00:03:29,930
B-But Tsubasa...

62
00:03:29,930 --> 00:03:34,440
Yes. We plan to take Tsubasa-kun as well.

63
00:03:34,440 --> 00:03:41,440
But instead of forward, we want to take him as a playmaker.

64
00:03:34,440 --> 00:03:36,720
You did it, Tsubasa!

65
00:03:36,720 --> 00:03:37,980
I congratulate your championship!

66
00:03:37,980 --> 00:03:38,940
Thanks!

67
00:03:38,940 --> 00:03:41,440
- You really did it.
- Yes.

68
00:03:41,440 --> 00:03:46,550
We want you as our ace forward, Hyuga-kun.

69
00:03:46,550 --> 00:03:47,200
What?!

70
00:03:47,200 --> 00:03:52,370
Thus, Toho Academy will be invincible across the nation.

71
00:03:52,370 --> 00:03:57,290
It will be the ultimate golden duo of Tsubasa-kun and Hyuga-kun.

72
00:03:58,440 --> 00:04:01,680
M-Me and Tsubasa as a duo?

73
00:04:01,680 --> 00:04:03,420
Th-That's amazing!

74
00:04:03,420 --> 00:04:05,510
You'll be invincible, Captain!

75
00:04:05,510 --> 00:04:08,720
You'll come, right, Hyuga-kun?

76
00:04:08,720 --> 00:04:10,720
B-But...

77
00:04:10,720 --> 00:04:13,210
What are you waiting for?!

78
00:04:13,210 --> 00:04:14,740
Go, Kojiro!

79
00:04:14,740 --> 00:04:17,380
Hasn't your dream come true?

80
00:04:17,380 --> 00:04:18,440
Coach...

81
00:04:18,440 --> 00:04:19,780
Big brother!

82
00:04:19,780 --> 00:04:20,940
Kojiro!

83
00:04:20,940 --> 00:04:23,190
A-All of you...

84
00:04:23,240 --> 00:04:26,140
We congratulate your second place, big brother!

85
00:04:26,140 --> 00:04:27,990
You did a great job, Kojiro!

86
00:04:27,990 --> 00:04:31,900
Losing to Tsubasa-kun in the final didn't diminish your pride at all.

87
00:04:31,900 --> 00:04:34,030
You don't have to give your answer right now.

88
00:04:34,030 --> 00:04:35,060
Let's go.

89
00:04:35,060 --> 00:04:35,790
Okay.

90
00:04:36,980 --> 00:04:38,790
Big brother...

91
00:04:42,480 --> 00:04:48,090
I-I... I want to join Toho Academy!

92
00:05:13,540 --> 00:05:16,790
Misaki-kun, it's about time to say goodbye, isn't it?

93
00:05:17,440 --> 00:05:18,790
Yes.

94
00:05:23,270 --> 00:05:24,670
Tsubasa!

95
00:05:25,470 --> 00:05:26,630
Mom.

96
00:05:26,630 --> 00:05:30,340
The situation is bad, Tsubasa! I found this at the hotel!

97
00:05:30,340 --> 00:05:31,600
What?

98
00:05:31,600 --> 00:05:37,020
Roberto... Roberto returned to Brazil all alone.

99
00:05:37,020 --> 00:05:38,230
What?!

100
00:05:43,320 --> 00:05:46,320
# To Tsubasa #

101
00:05:44,850 --> 00:05:46,320
Why?

102
00:05:46,320 --> 00:05:50,490
He promised. Why?

103
00:05:50,490 --> 00:05:53,120
Why did Roberto go alone?

104
00:05:53,120 --> 00:05:55,540
Tell me, kids! Why did Roberto do this?!

105
00:05:55,540 --> 00:05:56,410
Tsubasa...

106
00:05:56,410 --> 00:06:00,120
Tsubasa-kun, if you leave right now, maybe you can catch him.

107
00:06:01,180 --> 00:06:04,880
Exactly! If you hurry, you can catch him at the airport!

108
00:06:04,880 --> 00:06:06,140
Mister!

109
00:06:06,140 --> 00:06:07,090
Alright!

110
00:06:15,640 --> 00:06:17,020
Tsubasa-kun...

111
00:06:17,780 --> 00:06:20,520
Going to Brazil was your biggest dream.

112
00:06:21,160 --> 00:06:24,790
You have to catch Roberto, Tsubasa.

113
00:06:29,560 --> 00:06:31,340
Dear Tsubasa,

114
00:06:31,340 --> 00:06:33,450
Tsubasa, forgive me.

115
00:06:33,450 --> 00:06:38,280
I can't take you to Brazil.

116
00:06:38,280 --> 00:06:42,980
As you know, I have a condition called detached retina in my eyes.

117
00:06:42,980 --> 00:06:46,160
So I can't continue playing football.

118
00:06:46,160 --> 00:06:48,260
For me, whose only purpose in life was football...

119
00:06:48,260 --> 00:06:51,380
...this was a huge shock.

120
00:06:51,380 --> 00:06:58,160
But when I hit rock bottom, it was you, Tsubasa, who gave me the will to live.

121
00:06:58,220 --> 00:07:01,730
Your prodigious football instincts impressed me deeply...

122
00:07:01,730 --> 00:07:06,520
...and I wanted to raise you to be the best football player in the world.

123
00:07:06,520 --> 00:07:12,070
But Tsubasa, I can't take you to Brazil.

124
00:07:13,090 --> 00:07:17,790
If I take you, the Ozora family will be torn apart.

125
00:07:17,790 --> 00:07:21,080
It's better for families to stay together.

126
00:07:22,720 --> 00:07:27,170
But the real reason I'm not taking you is more about myself.

127
00:07:28,180 --> 00:07:36,180
Whatever the reason, as someone who has quit football, I am a disgrace.

128
00:07:36,180 --> 00:07:40,940
So for you, who truly wants to dedicate your life to football...

129
00:07:40,940 --> 00:07:42,690
...there's nothing I can teach you.

130
00:07:42,690 --> 00:07:48,900
Even if I could, as you progress, training will get harder...

131
00:07:48,900 --> 00:07:52,900
...and I'm afraid of losing my eyesight.

132
00:07:52,900 --> 00:07:55,240
By then, it will be too late.

133
00:07:55,240 --> 00:07:58,950
You're the one who has to accept the situation, Tsubasa.

134
00:08:01,000 --> 00:08:04,070
No luck. He really has turned off his phone.

135
00:08:04,070 --> 00:08:05,960
I can't reach him.

136
00:08:05,960 --> 00:08:10,210
Roberto... You're not a disgrace, Roberto!

137
00:08:10,210 --> 00:08:16,890
It was you who taught me football... Real football, Roberto!

138
00:08:19,180 --> 00:08:20,220
Tsubasa...

139
00:08:20,220 --> 00:08:24,690
Even if you stay in Japan, I'm sure you'll become a wonderful player.

140
00:08:25,360 --> 00:08:29,110
I'm sure you will, even without me.

141
00:08:29,950 --> 00:08:32,990
I'll return to Brazil alone.

142
00:08:32,990 --> 00:08:37,110
Here, I'll part ways with you forever.

143
00:08:37,710 --> 00:08:38,740
Tsubasa...

144
00:08:39,900 --> 00:08:40,870
Farewell.

145
00:08:51,670 --> 00:08:56,880
I worked so hard to fulfill my dream of going to Brazil with Roberto.

146
00:08:58,640 --> 00:09:01,620
As I promised, I also became the champion!

147
00:09:03,850 --> 00:09:06,350
Why are you going back alone?

148
00:09:20,030 --> 00:09:21,160
Roberto!

149
00:09:24,580 --> 00:09:25,790
Roberto...

150
00:09:28,160 --> 00:09:29,790
Roberto!

151
00:09:33,520 --> 00:09:34,550
Roberto!

152
00:09:39,720 --> 00:09:40,890
Roberto...

153
00:09:41,690 --> 00:09:42,940
Why?

154
00:09:45,260 --> 00:09:47,890
Why are you going alone?!

155
00:09:47,890 --> 00:09:51,040
Roberto!

156
00:09:55,070 --> 00:10:00,070
Translation: ARE-YOU-SURE
AreyousureSubs Presents

157
00:10:00,070 --> 00:10:03,910
— A Few Days After the National Youth Football Tournament, Nankatsu City —

158
00:10:03,910 --> 00:10:05,830
# For Rent #

159
00:10:14,170 --> 00:10:16,210
Taro, is your recovery over?

160
00:10:17,640 --> 00:10:19,300
Yes, I'm ready.

161
00:10:20,100 --> 00:10:21,430
Then let's go now.

162
00:10:22,240 --> 00:10:23,550
Okay.

163
00:10:23,550 --> 00:10:25,260
# Nankatsu Elementary #

164
00:10:25,260 --> 00:10:27,060
# Soccer Club #

165
00:10:27,660 --> 00:10:29,180
Sorry, kids.

166
00:10:29,180 --> 00:10:31,550
I made you all come all this way.

167
00:10:31,550 --> 00:10:32,980
It's nothing.

168
00:10:32,980 --> 00:10:37,700
Misaki is an important teammate of Nankatsu SC, after all.

169
00:10:37,700 --> 00:10:40,320
I also got Wakabayashi-san's signature.

170
00:10:40,320 --> 00:10:43,710
He said he'll come to see Misaki off tomorrow.

171
00:10:43,710 --> 00:10:46,730
Tsubasa didn't come again today?

172
00:10:46,730 --> 00:10:50,740
Yes, he's still locked himself in his room from the shock.

173
00:10:50,740 --> 00:10:52,630
I see.

174
00:10:52,630 --> 00:10:56,780
What will he do without Roberto, I wonder?

175
00:10:58,480 --> 00:10:59,910
I heard something.

176
00:10:59,910 --> 00:11:03,600
Wasn't Tsubasa requested by Toho Academy?

177
00:11:03,600 --> 00:11:04,620
Yes.

178
00:11:04,620 --> 00:11:06,040
Great.

179
00:11:06,040 --> 00:11:09,360
The fact that Toho Academy wants him...

180
00:11:09,360 --> 00:11:12,230
He hasn't decided to go yet.

181
00:11:12,230 --> 00:11:15,960
He could continue at Nankatsu Middle School with us.

182
00:11:15,960 --> 00:11:21,320
But a talent like Tsubasa would be wasted at Nankatsu Middle School.

183
00:11:21,320 --> 00:11:28,830
If Tsubasa goes to Nankatsu, as Shutetsu, we could settle the score this time though.

184
00:11:30,320 --> 00:11:32,240
What's up, Takasugi?

185
00:11:32,240 --> 00:11:39,220
I just realized that Nankatsu SC will break up once middle school starts.

186
00:11:41,620 --> 00:11:47,930
That's why Tsubasa should have a part in Misaki's farewell gift.

187
00:11:51,930 --> 00:11:53,690
Are you sure, Taro?

188
00:11:53,690 --> 00:11:55,440
You lied to everyone.

189
00:11:56,190 --> 00:11:57,040
Yes.

190
00:11:59,730 --> 00:12:01,520
M-Misaki-kun!

191
00:12:01,520 --> 00:12:02,240
What?!

192
00:12:03,210 --> 00:12:04,240
Guys!

193
00:12:04,240 --> 00:12:06,920
Misaki! Why do you have luggage in your hands?

194
00:12:06,920 --> 00:12:09,330
Weren't you leaving tomorrow?

195
00:12:09,960 --> 00:12:11,180
I'm sorry.

196
00:12:11,180 --> 00:12:14,710
I thought it would be hard to part after seeing you.

197
00:12:14,710 --> 00:12:16,790
You're so cruel, Misaki!

198
00:12:16,790 --> 00:12:18,460
I'm sorry...

199
00:12:18,460 --> 00:12:20,620
Ishizaki, then we have to hurry.

200
00:12:20,620 --> 00:12:21,840
That's right!

201
00:12:21,840 --> 00:12:23,920
Misaki, which bus are you taking?

202
00:12:25,010 --> 00:12:27,090
The one coming in 15 minutes.

203
00:12:27,090 --> 00:12:28,310
Damn it!

204
00:12:28,310 --> 00:12:31,230
Alright, I'm flying to Tsubasa right now.

205
00:12:31,230 --> 00:12:33,250
I'll call Wakabayashi-san too.

206
00:12:33,250 --> 00:12:35,020
Alright.

207
00:12:36,150 --> 00:12:38,020
Kids...

208
00:12:38,720 --> 00:12:40,270
What?! He's not there?!

209
00:12:40,270 --> 00:12:43,680
I guess he went by the riverside again today.

210
00:12:43,680 --> 00:12:44,780
Did something happen?

211
00:12:44,780 --> 00:12:47,240
Misaki is leaving today, it seems.

212
00:12:47,240 --> 00:12:48,410
What?!

213
00:12:54,270 --> 00:13:02,170
Advanced dribbling, new shooting techniques, effective training programs...

214
00:13:02,170 --> 00:13:09,600
In the notebook you left me, there's everything I might need.

215
00:13:09,600 --> 00:13:10,550
But...

216
00:13:13,890 --> 00:13:19,480
Roberto, I still wanted to go to Brazil.

217
00:13:19,480 --> 00:13:21,440
Tsubasa!

218
00:13:23,810 --> 00:13:24,940
Ishizaki-kun?

219
00:13:24,940 --> 00:13:26,830
It's an emergency, Tsubasa!

220
00:13:26,830 --> 00:13:27,950
Misaki...

221
00:13:33,320 --> 00:13:35,080
The bus has arrived.

222
00:13:42,470 --> 00:13:45,560
Ishizaki-kun, come quickly.

223
00:13:47,050 --> 00:13:49,300
Taro, let's go.

224
00:13:49,300 --> 00:13:50,580
Okay.

225
00:13:51,390 --> 00:13:53,390
See you, everyone.

226
00:13:53,390 --> 00:13:55,390
Are you leaving, Misaki?

227
00:13:55,390 --> 00:13:56,600
Yes.

228
00:13:56,600 --> 00:13:59,350
Give my regards to Tsubasa-kun too.

229
00:14:02,150 --> 00:14:03,820
Misaki, see you.

230
00:14:03,820 --> 00:14:05,240
Take care, Misaki.

231
00:14:05,240 --> 00:14:06,680
Farewell.

232
00:14:09,150 --> 00:14:10,910
- Take care!
- Misaki!

233
00:14:14,800 --> 00:14:16,100
Misaki-kun!

234
00:14:23,380 --> 00:14:25,380
Tsubasa-kun!

235
00:14:25,380 --> 00:14:27,630
Misaki-kun!

236
00:14:29,130 --> 00:14:31,640
Misaki-kun!

237
00:14:33,260 --> 00:14:35,180
Tsubasa-kun, farewell!

238
00:14:35,180 --> 00:14:36,930
Take care!

239
00:14:36,930 --> 00:14:38,770
Tsubasa.

240
00:14:39,940 --> 00:14:42,940
Catch, Misaki-kun!

241
00:14:49,320 --> 00:14:52,780
# Let's play together again on the national team.
- Ozora Tsubasa #

242
00:14:53,200 --> 00:14:54,780
Misaki-kun...

243
00:14:58,300 --> 00:15:00,290
Thank you, Tsubasa-kun!

244
00:15:00,290 --> 00:15:02,790
Thank you, guys!

245
00:15:09,180 --> 00:15:12,420
Farewell... Farewell, Misaki-kun!

246
00:15:13,900 --> 00:15:15,970
So Misaki has left too.

247
00:15:16,660 --> 00:15:17,850
Wakabayashi-kun.

248
00:15:18,320 --> 00:15:19,470
Wakabayashi.

249
00:15:20,350 --> 00:15:22,060
Misaki as well?

250
00:15:22,060 --> 00:15:25,900
Tsubasa, I'm going to Germany.

251
00:15:28,340 --> 00:15:32,200
Genzo, you'll be going to middle school next year, right?

252
00:15:32,200 --> 00:15:33,070
Yes.

253
00:15:34,270 --> 00:15:40,430
Frankly, Genzo, this year may be the last year I coach you.

254
00:15:41,080 --> 00:15:43,820
The Japanese Football Federation...

255
00:15:43,820 --> 00:15:48,730
...asked if I could coach in Germany.

256
00:15:48,730 --> 00:15:53,220
I want to go and see it to raise the level of Japanese football.

257
00:15:53,220 --> 00:15:55,470
Th-This...

258
00:15:56,080 --> 00:15:58,440
Starting next spring...

259
00:15:58,440 --> 00:16:04,480
...I want to see European football for 2 years, or longer if possible.

260
00:16:04,480 --> 00:16:10,230
That's the situation, Genzo! Won't you come with me?!

261
00:16:10,230 --> 00:16:12,240
What?!

262
00:16:13,740 --> 00:16:16,030
You're going to Germany?

263
00:16:16,030 --> 00:16:22,040
Tsubasa, after hearing you were going to Brazil, I started thinking too.

264
00:16:22,040 --> 00:16:24,900
If I want to become a world-famous player...

265
00:16:24,900 --> 00:16:27,540
...I can't fall behind the football in the rest of the world.

266
00:16:27,540 --> 00:16:32,000
The German league is one of the best leagues in the world...

267
00:16:32,000 --> 00:16:35,540
...and it harbors great goalkeepers.

268
00:16:35,540 --> 00:16:38,370
The place I need to go is Germany.

269
00:16:38,370 --> 00:16:41,060
I want to become the best goalkeeper in the world.

270
00:16:41,060 --> 00:16:43,310
Wakabayashi-san...

271
00:16:46,100 --> 00:16:47,800
Do your best and come back.

272
00:16:47,800 --> 00:16:52,020
I'm sure you can become the best goalkeeper in the world, Wakabayashi-kun.

273
00:16:52,020 --> 00:16:53,990
Yes, I'll do my best.

274
00:16:53,990 --> 00:16:59,830
But before that, Tsubasa, will you accept a match with me?

275
00:16:59,830 --> 00:17:02,830
Yes, gladly.

276
00:17:03,040 --> 00:17:07,040
One Week Later

277
00:17:13,340 --> 00:17:18,340
Our first encounter and our first battle happened here too, Wakabayashi-kun.

278
00:17:19,060 --> 00:17:21,850
Exactly, Tsubasa.

279
00:17:22,300 --> 00:17:23,370
Come, Tsubasa!

280
00:17:23,370 --> 00:17:25,040
A one-on-one battle!

281
00:17:25,040 --> 00:17:26,100
Alright.

282
00:17:26,100 --> 00:17:27,580
Tsubasa...

283
00:17:27,580 --> 00:17:29,100
Wakabayashi-san...

284
00:17:30,130 --> 00:17:31,110
I'm coming!

285
00:17:36,240 --> 00:17:38,070
Take this, Wakabayashi-kun!

286
00:17:38,950 --> 00:17:41,950
I won't concede a goal from outside the penalty area to anyone, including you!

287
00:17:47,160 --> 00:17:48,830
H-He got past!

288
00:17:49,580 --> 00:17:51,080
No, it hit the post!

289
00:17:52,750 --> 00:17:53,710
Tsubasa!

290
00:18:02,910 --> 00:18:04,470
H-He caught it!

291
00:18:13,690 --> 00:18:15,780
That's to be expected from Wakabayashi-kun.

292
00:18:17,040 --> 00:18:18,780
That was just luck just now.

293
00:18:18,780 --> 00:18:22,030
The ball happened to come to where I randomly jumped.

294
00:18:31,120 --> 00:18:34,300
Tsubasa, until I become a professional player in Germany...

295
00:18:34,300 --> 00:18:36,360
...I'm not planning to return to Japan.

296
00:18:38,510 --> 00:18:42,010
Wakabayashi-kun, I...

297
00:18:47,340 --> 00:18:49,980
I will go to Nankatsu Middle School with everyone!

298
00:18:50,780 --> 00:18:52,480
Hooray!

299
00:18:52,480 --> 00:18:54,360
Nankatsu Middle School!

300
00:18:54,360 --> 00:18:57,570
I'll be able to play with Tsubasa again!

301
00:18:57,570 --> 00:18:59,630
I haven't given up on my dreams.

302
00:18:59,630 --> 00:19:04,010
Fighting together with everyone at Nankatsu Middle School, I'll go to Brazil one day.

303
00:19:04,010 --> 00:19:04,990
Is that so?

304
00:19:04,990 --> 00:19:09,020
Then let's be in the Japanese National Team in our next encounter.

305
00:19:09,020 --> 00:19:09,500
Yes.

306
00:19:17,660 --> 00:19:21,880
Until then, farewell, Tsubasa.

307
00:19:26,100 --> 00:19:28,930
— 3 Years Later —

308
00:19:30,350 --> 00:19:34,910
Wakabayashi Genzo made great saves in the last match as well.

309
00:19:34,910 --> 00:19:39,690
He's about to succeed in becoming the ace goalkeeper of the B team.

310
00:19:40,900 --> 00:19:43,160
Quite good.

311
00:19:46,540 --> 00:19:48,540
Hey, Ishizaki!

312
00:19:48,540 --> 00:19:49,580
Hey.

313
00:19:49,580 --> 00:19:51,830
Was your spring break good?

314
00:19:51,830 --> 00:19:55,330
Nankatsu Middle School Soccer Club, 3rd Grade
Ryo Ishizaki

315
00:19:51,830 --> 00:19:54,680
You say spring break, but...

316
00:19:54,680 --> 00:19:59,290
...all we did was win the prefectural tournament and become champions again.

317
00:19:59,290 --> 00:20:03,470
How good can a 3-day vacation be?

318
00:20:03,470 --> 00:20:05,220
# Teppei Kisugi #

319
00:20:03,470 --> 00:20:05,470
I guess you're right.

320
00:20:05,470 --> 00:20:11,300
With Tsubasa on the team, it's impossible to lose early and rest for a long time.

321
00:20:05,640 --> 00:20:08,220
# Mamoru Izawa #

322
00:20:08,310 --> 00:20:10,600
# Hajime Taki #

323
00:20:10,680 --> 00:20:12,980
# Shingo Takasugi #

324
00:20:11,300 --> 00:20:12,980
Well said.

325
00:20:12,980 --> 00:20:19,320
Idiot! As soon as the tournament ended, Tsubasa joined the high school training for 3 days.

326
00:20:17,780 --> 00:20:19,320
Good morning, Sanae.

327
00:20:19,320 --> 00:20:21,440
Good morning.

328
00:20:19,320 --> 00:20:21,440
Nankatsu Middle School Soccer Club Manager, 3rd Grade
Sanae Nakazawa

329
00:20:21,440 --> 00:20:26,930
Izawa, Kisugi, Taki, and Takasugi, the aces of Nankatsu SC...

330
00:20:26,930 --> 00:20:32,080
...joined Nankatsu Middle School with Tsubasa for new goals.

331
00:20:32,080 --> 00:20:35,040
# Yuzo Morisaki / Masato Nakazato / Kenichi Iwami #

332
00:20:32,080 --> 00:20:38,240
Nankatsu Middle School, even though it's a public school, is the flag-bearer in middle school football.

333
00:20:36,170 --> 00:20:38,920
# Tsuyoshi Oda / Hiroshi Nagano #

334
00:20:38,240 --> 00:20:44,620
On the other hand, Urabe, Kishida, Nishio, and Nakaya, players from Nankatsu SC...

335
00:20:44,620 --> 00:20:46,630
...joined Otoma Middle School...

336
00:20:46,630 --> 00:20:50,430
...and chose to fight against Nankatsu, led by Ozora Tsubasa.

337
00:20:52,180 --> 00:20:53,680
# Toho Academy Soccer Field #

338
