Toho Academy Middle School Soccer Club President, 3rd Grade
Hyuga Kojiro

345
00:20:58,560 --> 00:21:02,570
At this rate, we can't beat Nankatsu Middle School this year either!

346
00:21:02,570 --> 00:21:06,070
