Sawada Takeshi

351
00:21:11,800 --> 00:21:14,080
It's been a while, Hyuga-san!

352
00:21:14,820 --> 00:21:16,460
So you came, Takeshi.

353
00:21:16,460 --> 00:21:17,710
Yes!

354
00:21:17,710 --> 00:21:20,980
Alright! With this, our roster is complete!

355
00:21:20,980 --> 00:21:26,910
We, as Toho Academy, will prevent Nankatsu Middle School's dream of being champion 3 times in a row!

356
00:21:26,910 --> 00:21:28,090
Yes!

357
00:21:30,100 --> 00:21:31,820
